---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import papelBg from '../assets/branding/papel.png';
import plumaTrazo from '../assets/branding/pluma-trazo.png';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../config/site';

// Independent Photos from Nuestra Historia
import imgWall from '../assets/history/Sitio WEB_PC (2).png';
import imgArtist from '../assets/history/Sitio WEB_PC (3).png';
import imgEasel from '../assets/history/Sitio WEB_PC (4).png';
import imgPainting from '../assets/history/Sitio WEB_PC (5).png';

// Bird Cutouts for 3D Collage Effect
import birdCachana from '../assets/history/Cachaña.png';
import birdChucao from '../assets/history/Chucao.png';
import birdPicaflor from '../assets/history/Picaflor.png';
import birdPilpilen from '../assets/history/Pilpilen.png';
---

<section 
  id="nosotros" 
  class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 relative border-y border-[#2b4f25]/15 shadow-inner overflow-hidden"
  style={`background-image: url('${papelBg.src}'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;`}
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- 1. Nuestra Historia Block -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Custom Dynamic Photo & Bird Cutouts Collage (Larger) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-6 relative flex justify-center py-8 px-4">
        
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-xl lg:max-w-2xl p-3.5 bg-white/75 backdrop-blur-xs rounded-3xl border-2 border-white/90 shadow-2xl">
          
          <!-- 4-Photo Grid Container -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3.5 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-[#1b3519]/5 p-2.5">
            
            <!-- Photo 1: Close-up painting -->
            <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-white shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-300">
              <Image 
                src={imgPainting} 
                alt="Pintando ave en acrílico" 
                class="w-full h-44 sm:h-52 md:h-56 lg:h-60 object-cover"
              />
            </div>

            <!-- Photo 2: Gallery exhibition wall -->
            <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-white shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-300">
              <Image 
                src={imgWall} 
                alt="Exposición De Plumas, Sal y Mar en Galería" 
                class="w-full h-44 sm:h-52 md:h-56 lg:h-60 object-cover"
              />
            </div>

            <!-- Photo 3: Framed painting on easel -->
            <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-white shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-300">
              <Image 
                src={imgEasel} 
                alt="Cuadro de Cachaña en atril" 
                class="w-full h-44 sm:h-52 md:h-56 lg:h-60 object-cover"
              />
            </div>

            <!-- Photo 4: Artist working -->
            <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-white shadow-md hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-300">
              <Image 
                src={imgArtist} 
                alt="Fundadora María de los Ángeles pintando" 
                class="w-full h-44 sm:h-52 md:h-56 lg:h-60 object-cover"
              />
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Overlapping Bird Cutouts (Floating 3D Collage Effect) -->
          <!-- Bird 1: Cachaña (Top Left) -->
          <div class="absolute -top-9 -left-8 w-32 sm:w-44 md:w-48 z-20 pointer-events-none drop-shadow-[0_14px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.38)] transform -rotate-6">
            <Image src={birdCachana} alt="Cachaña Ilustración" class="w-full h-auto object-contain" />
          </div>

          <!-- Bird 2: Chucao (Center Overlap) -->
          <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-28 sm:w-36 md:w-40 z-30 pointer-events-none drop-shadow-[0_12px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.45)] transform rotate-3">
            <Image src={birdChucao} alt="Chucao Ilustración" class="w-full h-auto object-contain" />
          </div>

          <!-- Bird 3: Pilpilén (Top Right) -->
          <div class="absolute -top-8 -right-6 w-28 sm:w-36 md:w-40 z-20 pointer-events-none drop-shadow-[0_12px_18px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] transform rotate-12">
            <Image src={birdPilpilen} alt="Pilpilén Ilustración" class="w-full h-auto object-contain" />
          </div>

          <!-- Bird 4: Picaflor (Bottom Right) -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-9 -right-8 w-32 sm:w-44 md:w-48 z-20 pointer-events-none drop-shadow-[0_14px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.38)] transform -rotate-12">
            <Image src={birdPicaflor} alt="Picaflor Ilustración" class="w-full h-auto object-contain" />
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Narrative Text -->
      <div class="md:col-span-6 space-y-5">
        
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-[#1b3519]">
          Nuestra Historia :
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#1b3519] font-serif leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Cada ave fue pintada en la técnica acrílico como un proyecto paralelo y como medida para encauzar la ansiedad de la tesis de pregrado.
          </p>
          <p>
            Nunca fueron pensadas para un juego, pero una semana después de la defensa de la tesis, se montó en Museo y Galería Bags Marine: <strong>‘De Plumas, Sal y Mar’</strong>, la serie de 32 pinturas de aves de Chile que le dieron vida al Juego Cachañando.
          </p>
          <p>
            La exposición estuvo abierta al público de manera gratuita todo septiembre del 2025. En ese mismo mes, sale a la venta Cachañando.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Founder Quote -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/90 border-l-4 border-[#35592f] shadow-lg backdrop-blur-xs mt-6">
          <blockquote class="italic text-base sm:text-lg font-serif text-[#1b3519] leading-relaxed">
            "Las pinturas llaman la atención y que tengan un propósito de fondo, materializado en algo simple y cercano como un juego de cartas, termina de cerrar el círculo de <strong>promover las especies de aves de Chile en pro de la conservación de ellas</strong>"
          </blockquote>
          <span class="block mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#35592f] uppercase tracking-wider">
            - María de los Ángeles, fundadora de Lëpigames
          </span>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- 2. Lëpigames (Región de los Lagos) Block -->
    <div class="pt-10 border-t border-[#2b4f25]/15 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6">
      
      <!-- Title with Feather Stroke Accent -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3.5">
        <Image 
          src={plumaTrazo} 
          alt="Trazo de pluma" 
          class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 object-contain transform -rotate-12 drop-shadow-xs" 
        />
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-[#1b3519]">
          Lëpigames
        </h2>
        <span class="text-lg sm:text-2xl font-serif italic text-[#35592f]">
          (Región de los Lagos)
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Card Definition with Background Watermark Feather -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white/85 border border-[#2b4f25]/20 shadow-lg backdrop-blur-xs text-left sm:text-center space-y-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto relative overflow-hidden">
        
        <!-- Feather stroke watermark in card corner -->
        <div class="absolute -right-8 -bottom-8 opacity-20 pointer-events-none w-48 sm:w-60 transform rotate-12">
          <Image src={plumaTrazo} alt="" class="w-full h-auto object-contain" />
        </div>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-xl text-[#1b3519] font-serif leading-relaxed relative z-10">
          Del mapudungun-huilliche, <strong class="text-[#2b4f25] font-bold">lëpi-</strong> ‘plumas’ + <strong class="text-[#2b4f25] font-bold">games</strong> del inglés, ‘juego’.<br/>
          <em class="text-[#35592f] font-medium">Juego de plumas o juego de aves;</em>
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#1b3519]/90 font-serif leading-relaxed relative z-10">
          Busca representar la identidad territorial de la Región de Los Lagos a través de las aves, conectando con diferentes personas mediante el juego, el arte y la ciencia.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
